(7083126, 1077951, 27812, '<td valign="top">Clean Sweep, green sweep but sweep we shall. swept right into a tough challenge and onto a podium of delight for me.<br/>Thank you very much for sharing your art with us. 8</td>', 'Clean Sweep, green sweep but sweep we shall. swept right into a tough challenge and onto a podium of delight for me.Thank you very much for sharing your art with us. 8', '2013-08-07 10:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
