(7083237, 1077924, 96751, '<td valign="top">This just might be my sentimental favorite of the challenge, and I''d give it a PH blue. The crop is masterful, and bold. So eloquent and full of love, possibility, tenderness. The enormous negative space at her back, filled with a curled paper of the day''s news and other pedestrian elements hints at time filled with ordinariness, while the child''s gaze and the tender touch of the almost unseen adult tell us of what is truly great. Bravo.</td>', 'This just might be my sentimental favorite of the challenge, and I''d give it a PH blue. The crop is masterful, and bold. So eloquent and full of love, possibility, tenderness. The enormous negative space at her back, filled with a curled paper of the day''s news and other pedestrian elements hints at time filled with ordinariness, while the child''s gaze and the tender touch of the almost unseen adult tell us of what is truly great. Bravo.', '2013-08-07 13:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
