(7083284, 1078255, 2553, '<td valign="top">I felt compelled to comment on this because the I really like the concept here.  I do find the image a bit confusing - it almost looks like a composited image, but what really detracts, for me, is the lack of full tonal range.  Without the stark, blown-out whites, I think this would have made a wonderful image and I would have been inclined to give it a fairly high score.</td>', 'I felt compelled to comment on this because the I really like the concept here.  I do find the image a bit confusing - it almost looks like a composited image, but what really detracts, for me, is the lack of full tonal range.  Without the stark, blown-out whites, I think this would have made a wonderful image and I would have been inclined to give it a fairly high score.', '2013-08-07 14:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
