(7083921, 1077928, 27812, '<td valign="top">I adore this image. one of my favorite songs, meaningful lyrics from the great Leonard Cohen, ''Ring the bell that still rings, forget your perfect harmony...''<br/>Excellent composition, focus and warm colors. Like life itself.<br/>Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 10</td>', 'I adore this image. one of my favorite songs, meaningful lyrics from the great Leonard Cohen, ''Ring the bell that still rings, forget your perfect harmony...''Excellent composition, focus and warm colors. Like life itself.Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 10', '2013-08-08 06:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083924, 1078255, 27812, '<td valign="top">From the darkness of pain into the light. I go with the rhythm and flow of her whom I loved so much. She who killed my soul.<br/>Love the effects and creativity.<br/>Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 8</td>', 'From the darkness of pain into the light. I go with the rhythm and flow of her whom I loved so much. She who killed my soul.Love the effects and creativity.Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 8', '2013-08-08 06:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083925, 1078312, 27812, '<td valign="top">He ain''t heavy, he''s my brother. I have never been heavy for my family at DPC, they always carried me. Love energy, positive and addictive. I want to shout, "My turn, give me a turn!"<br/>Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 8</td>', 'He ain''t heavy, he''s my brother. I have never been heavy for my family at DPC, they always carried me. Love energy, positive and addictive. I want to shout, "My turn, give me a turn!"Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 8', '2013-08-08 06:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083926, 1077879, 27812, '<td valign="top">We are the dancers, we flow with the sounds and the winds and tunes and rhymes. Will I dance for you Jesus? This is life with all the imperfections one can expect to see; light and darkness, forms without face. Love it. Thanks from gran''pa Pete to the little angel for the song and dance, for her precious time.<br/>Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 7</td>', 'We are the dancers, we flow with the sounds and the winds and tunes and rhymes. Will I dance for you Jesus? This is life with all the imperfections one can expect to see; light and darkness, forms without face. Love it. Thanks from gran''pa Pete to the little angel for the song and dance, for her precious time.Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 7', '2013-08-08 06:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083927, 1078284, 27812, '<td valign="top">Dark and full of pain, anxiety and suffering. Every moment an attack on your ability to not the silver lining which will always be there. That silver lining so well presented here.<br/>Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 8</td>', 'Dark and full of pain, anxiety and suffering. Every moment an attack on your ability to not the silver lining which will always be there. That silver lining so well presented here.Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 8', '2013-08-08 06:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083930, 1078331, 27812, '<td valign="top">Do you see the sadness in her eyes? look carefully. touches my soul, this image. So young so young. Will we ever comprehend hardship and pain? Not even the bright yellow balloons and their Smilies or the windmills can remove the darkness I fell. This is extremely well captured.<br/>Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 10</td>', 'Do you see the sadness in her eyes? look carefully. touches my soul, this image. So young so young. Will we ever comprehend hardship and pain? Not even the bright yellow balloons and their Smilies or the windmills can remove the darkness I fell. This is extremely well captured.Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 10', '2013-08-08 06:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083931, 1078302, 27812, '<td valign="top">Hey you, yes you Doc, this wink is just for you. My dear Mr Catterman, I humbly accept your gracious smile. Ma, I LOVE cats!<br/>Extraordinary capture, arty, well processed and presented.<br/>Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 9</td>', 'Hey you, yes you Doc, this wink is just for you. My dear Mr Catterman, I humbly accept your gracious smile. Ma, I LOVE cats!Extraordinary capture, arty, well processed and presented.Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 9', '2013-08-08 06:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083932, 1078275, 27812, '<td valign="top">Forget the boundaries set by man, play the earth, she is your for the taking ..... Live life to the full, do not bound yourself with borders and rules, but remember, you will be called to justice for what you did and didn''t do.<br/>Tell me, did he stay up, the red 4?<br/>Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 6</td>', 'Forget the boundaries set by man, play the earth, she is your for the taking ..... Live life to the full, do not bound yourself with borders and rules, but remember, you will be called to justice for what you did and didn''t do.Tell me, did he stay up, the red 4?Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 6', '2013-08-08 06:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083934, 1078278, 27812, '<td valign="top">Presence, the present, a gift. For living as it presents itself. No one says it will always be a welcome gift, but a gift it is. What I am is just grace, what I have is just on loan. Nice catch, well presented!<br/>Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 7</td>', 'Presence, the present, a gift. For living as it presents itself. No one says it will always be a welcome gift, but a gift it is. What I am is just grace, what I have is just on loan. Nice catch, well presented!Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 7', '2013-08-08 06:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083935, 1078190, 27812, '<td valign="top">I came face-toface with you today when you presented your art to us, to me. I love your creative, subtle mind and know you deserve to be seen. Adore this work!<br/>Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 10</td>', 'I came face-toface with you today when you presented your art to us, to me. I love your creative, subtle mind and know you deserve to be seen. Adore this work!Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 10', '2013-08-08 06:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083936, 1077980, 27812, '<td valign="top">It is your choice bro, you can sit and wait for the waves to come to you, or you can go get them. Get up, get out, go make your surf. You alone can do it. Excellent work!<br/>Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 8</td>', 'It is your choice bro, you can sit and wait for the waves to come to you, or you can go get them. Get up, get out, go make your surf. You alone can do it. Excellent work!Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 8', '2013-08-08 06:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083938, 1078277, 27812, '<td valign="top">I have a sinking feeling! LOL Look at that expression, love love love it. So creative and so well presented. The luminous water is simply marvelous. How did you do it?<br/>Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 9</td>', 'I have a sinking feeling! LOL Look at that expression, love love love it. So creative and so well presented. The luminous water is simply marvelous. How did you do it?Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 9', '2013-08-08 06:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083939, 1078225, 27812, '<td valign="top">Yes, the face of the beast inside all of us. We can look down and avoid contact of any nature, we can turn around but not run away. In the absence of a logical choice, I chose to stand and face it. Knowing I am not alone, I will stare it down. Yes cancer, you took my body, but you will never take my mind!<br/>Strong symbols, strong composition and very apt in this challenge! <br/> Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 9</td>', 'Yes, the face of the beast inside all of us. We can look down and avoid contact of any nature, we can turn around but not run away. In the absence of a logical choice, I chose to stand and face it. Knowing I am not alone, I will stare it down. Yes cancer, you took my body, but you will never take my mind!Strong symbols, strong composition and very apt in this challenge!  Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 9', '2013-08-08 06:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083942, 1078252, 27812, '<td valign="top">Hi-ho silver, whatta'' you doing out there? LOL. Nature allowing the most beautiful acts of nature to procreate. Love the warm rich and refreshing use of a sunset to enhance the beauty of creating life for tomorrow!<br/>Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 8</td>', 'Hi-ho silver, whatta'' you doing out there? LOL. Nature allowing the most beautiful acts of nature to procreate. Love the warm rich and refreshing use of a sunset to enhance the beauty of creating life for tomorrow!Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 8', '2013-08-08 06:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083944, 1077934, 27812, '<td valign="top">This image is screaming at me, the clean lines and blood red. The grey of the sky and concrete and neutral marble enhances the drama of the outcry.<br/>Love it.<br/>Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 9</td>', 'This image is screaming at me, the clean lines and blood red. The grey of the sky and concrete and neutral marble enhances the drama of the outcry.Love it.Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 9', '2013-08-08 07:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083945, 1078311, 27812, '<td valign="top">Perfect balance and harmony. Then I realize, not even the darkest threatening sky can stop the waterfall from providing us the calm serenity of flowing water. Not even the stormy water can fade the green of the grass. balance, perfect balance.<br/>Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 9</td>', 'Perfect balance and harmony. Then I realize, not even the darkest threatening sky can stop the waterfall from providing us the calm serenity of flowing water. Not even the stormy water can fade the green of the grass. balance, perfect balance.Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 9', '2013-08-08 07:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083946, 1078248, 27812, '<td valign="top">Little Angel, <br/>Thank you for posing so beautifully for gran''pa Pete. Thank you for the smile. Why did you close those big eyes? Let me know if the photographer paid you for this hard work. <br/>Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 8</td>', 'Little Angel, Thank you for posing so beautifully for gran''pa Pete. Thank you for the smile. Why did you close those big eyes? Let me know if the photographer paid you for this hard work. Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 8', '2013-08-08 07:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083948, 1078294, 27812, '<td valign="top">Missing the iced coffee on that table. Fabulous serene scene. I love books so you obviously caught me.<br/>The light must be from heaven.<br/>Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 7</td>', 'Missing the iced coffee on that table. Fabulous serene scene. I love books so you obviously caught me.The light must be from heaven.Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 7', '2013-08-08 07:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083952, 1077784, 27812, '<td valign="top">Graffiti in the tunnel, lit by light from man. Was it meant to be, was it what we think? Was it really the writing on the wall. A great HDR? effort. Perspective is calling me to follow those overhead lights from here to there, wondering what I will find.<br/>Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 7</td>', 'Graffiti in the tunnel, lit by light from man. Was it meant to be, was it what we think? Was it really the writing on the wall. A great HDR? effort. Perspective is calling me to follow those overhead lights from here to there, wondering what I will find.Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 7', '2013-08-08 07:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083954, 1078176, 27812, '<td valign="top">That could have been me. Me and my grandson MJ. It saddens me that he will not have this beautiful memory.<br/>Thank you more than anything for reminding us that life is short, life is precious and that we have to live it in order to leave a footprint of ourselves.<br/>Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 10</td>', 'That could have been me. Me and my grandson MJ. It saddens me that he will not have this beautiful memory.Thank you more than anything for reminding us that life is short, life is precious and that we have to live it in order to leave a footprint of ourselves.Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 10', '2013-08-08 07:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083955, 1078314, 27812, '<td valign="top">Deceptively difficult to shoot, lovely if you succeed. I love spiders, even had one in a kindergarten class for educating the Korean kids not to just kill anything they see. <br/>Your background is beautiful, almost pastel colored and that enhances the patterns and shapes of the subject. I suspect this gentlewoman to have a pair of prize winning fangs. <br/>Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 7</td>', 'Deceptively difficult to shoot, lovely if you succeed. I love spiders, even had one in a kindergarten class for educating the Korean kids not to just kill anything they see. Your background is beautiful, almost pastel colored and that enhances the patterns and shapes of the subject. I suspect this gentlewoman to have a pair of prize winning fangs. Thank you for entering this wonderful work. Score 7', '2013-08-08 07:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083956, 1078308, 27812, '<td valign="top">The joy of a child''s laughter~! What a story to tell; sitting on an old newspaper on the dirt of the environment, the joy of a child with the light shining on his bright happy face.The mom, so proud and happy. This is their moment.<br/>Thank you for participating, I am honored! 10</td>', 'The joy of a child''s laughter~! What a story to tell; sitting on an old newspaper on the dirt of the environment, the joy of a child with the light shining on his bright happy face.The mom, so proud and happy. This is their moment.Thank you for participating, I am honored! 10', '2013-08-08 07:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083958, 1078161, 27812, '<td valign="top">If this is not a J.NN, then she has a problem with an artist as cool and gifted as she is. Simply art, simply beautiful. 10<br/> <br/> I score the image, and will give it a 10 again even if presented by ex Pres. Puppet Bush or Puppet master Cheney. Love this and wish I could make it more.</td>', 'If this is not a J.NN, then she has a problem with an artist as cool and gifted as she is. Simply art, simply beautiful. 10  I score the image, and will give it a 10 again even if presented by ex Pres. Puppet Bush or Puppet master Cheney. Love this and wish I could make it more.', '2013-08-08 07:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083959, 1078074, 27812, '<td valign="top">I have read ''The Shed'' so many time and found inspiration every time. Every time! This to me, is my shed, this is where I want to be when I met my Maker, looking up into the sky, admiring The Milky Way.<br/>Thank you for participating, I am honored! 10</td>', 'I have read ''The Shed'' so many time and found inspiration every time. Every time! This to me, is my shed, this is where I want to be when I met my Maker, looking up into the sky, admiring The Milky Way.Thank you for participating, I am honored! 10', '2013-08-08 07:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083960, 1078295, 27812, '<td valign="top">Yes! The man I see, the blurry one in the mirror driving off to be somewhere or anywhere. Tell me your story sir, tell me of your pain, those tears are blurring everything up.<br/>Thank you for participating, I am honored! 9<br/>Deserve to be a 10 so up it goes.</td>', 'Yes! The man I see, the blurry one in the mirror driving off to be somewhere or anywhere. Tell me your story sir, tell me of your pain, those tears are blurring everything up.Thank you for participating, I am honored! 9Deserve to be a 10 so up it goes.', '2013-08-08 07:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083961, 1077620, 27812, '<td valign="top">What happened to "come to my parlor, said the spider to the fly''? Beautiful capture and all the stories we can relay from this. I love it!<br/> Thank you for participating, I am honored! 9</td>', 'What happened to "come to my parlor, said the spider to the fly''? Beautiful capture and all the stories we can relay from this. I love it! Thank you for participating, I am honored! 9', '2013-08-08 07:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083962, 1078072, 27812, '<td valign="top">The survivors, givers of life to us! I love the action, the tension within the borders of this image. My friend, the grass, that grass which is not grass? I have seen that before, not sure if I would use it though.<br/>Thank you for participating, I am honored! 8<br/> <br/>Looking again, the liquefy filter takes away from the image, takes away the perfect score. But heck, I love the thoughts and processing and mind that went into this. Thank you my friend, thank you very much.</td>', 'The survivors, givers of life to us! I love the action, the tension within the borders of this image. My friend, the grass, that grass which is not grass? I have seen that before, not sure if I would use it though.Thank you for participating, I am honored! 8 Looking again, the liquefy filter takes away from the image, takes away the perfect score. But heck, I love the thoughts and processing and mind that went into this. Thank you my friend, thank you very much.', '2013-08-08 07:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
