(7084673, 1077925, 28427, '<td valign="top">Waiting for the bus makes a lot of people behave the same: is he coming yet? I hope he won''t be late because... And the tree: he completes the picture</td>', 'Waiting for the bus makes a lot of people behave the same: is he coming yet? I hope he won''t be late because... And the tree: he completes the picture', '2013-08-09 12:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7084690, 1078301, 28427, '<td valign="top">The perfect representation of the connection between 2 generations: the oldest protects and guides, the youngest admires and follows.  Together, hand in hand, they walk together and they bring joy to each other.</td>', 'The perfect representation of the connection between 2 generations: the oldest protects and guides, the youngest admires and follows.  Together, hand in hand, they walk together and they bring joy to each other.', '2013-08-09 12:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
