(7084693, 1078278, 28427, '<td valign="top">Don''t you ask yourself how many fingers have tried to find their way through this labyrinth? I also ask myself if this finger found the way</td>', 'Don''t you ask yourself how many fingers have tried to find their way through this labyrinth? I also ask myself if this finger found the way', '2013-08-09 13:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
