(7084727, 1078296, 28427, '<td valign="top">yep, a fan till the bitter end :)</td>', 'yep, a fan till the bitter end :)', '2013-08-09 14:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7084728, 1077879, 28427, '<td valign="top">Childhood, such a care-free period in our lives.  I love watching kids living that care-free time, not realizing themselves that it will all come to an end at a given moment.  And when seeing them like this, I wished I could "stop" time for them so that they can continue living their moment...</td>', 'Childhood, such a care-free period in our lives.  I love watching kids living that care-free time, not realizing themselves that it will all come to an end at a given moment.  And when seeing them like this, I wished I could "stop" time for them so that they can continue living their moment...', '2013-08-09 14:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
