(7084941, 1078255, 49018, '<td valign="top">Simply outstanding. The duality of light and darkness in multiple elements of the image, very well done.<br/>10</td>', 'Simply outstanding. The duality of light and darkness in multiple elements of the image, very well done.10', '2013-08-10 04:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7084942, 1078307, 49018, '<td valign="top">Good documentary photography, love the colour rendition.</td>', 'Good documentary photography, love the colour rendition.', '2013-08-10 04:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7084944, 1077875, 49018, '<td valign="top">Sad, intimate, great idea.</td>', 'Sad, intimate, great idea.', '2013-08-10 04:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7084945, 1078252, 49018, '<td valign="top">I had a farm in Africa at the foot of the Ngong Hills. [...]  There was no fat on it and no luxuriance anywhere; it was Africa distilled up through six thousand feet. like the strong and refined essence of a continent. The colours were dry and burnt. like the colours in pottery. The trees had a light delicate foliage, the structure of which was different from that of the trees in Europe; it did not grow in bows or cupolas, but in horizontal layers [...]<br/> <br/>Good job, indeed a wonderful story..</td>', 'I had a farm in Africa at the foot of the Ngong Hills. [...]  There was no fat on it and no luxuriance anywhere; it was Africa distilled up through six thousand feet. like the strong and refined essence of a continent. The colours were dry and burnt. like the colours in pottery. The trees had a light delicate foliage, the structure of which was different from that of the trees in Europe; it did not grow in bows or cupolas, but in horizontal layers [...] Good job, indeed a wonderful story..', '2013-08-10 04:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7084947, 1078306, 49018, '<td valign="top">Nice commentary :)</td>', 'Nice commentary :)', '2013-08-10 05:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7084948, 1078294, 49018, '<td valign="top">Well captured.</td>', 'Well captured.', '2013-08-10 05:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7084949, 1077879, 49018, '<td valign="top">Indeed, very well composed and very appropriate colour rendition.</td>', 'Indeed, very well composed and very appropriate colour rendition.', '2013-08-10 05:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7084950, 1078224, 49018, '<td valign="top">heheheh, pink floyd meet Magritte forever :D<br/>The hat not quite aligned detracts a bit from your effort, unless it''s flying away.<br/>I can''t help to think that it would just be the case for the heavier pseudo HDR processing which I don''t normally like. The alternative would be to show the bulb lights or to use transparent ones, at least in my eyes of course.<br/>One interesting thing is that if I squeeze my eyes the bulbs turn into giant drops decorating the suit, which is quite a wicked effect, but I digresses :D<br/> <br/>You can tell this image intrigued me, well done, good job.</td>', 'heheheh, pink floyd meet Magritte forever :DThe hat not quite aligned detracts a bit from your effort, unless it''s flying away.I can''t help to think that it would just be the case for the heavier pseudo HDR processing which I don''t normally like. The alternative would be to show the bulb lights or to use transparent ones, at least in my eyes of course.One interesting thing is that if I squeeze my eyes the bulbs turn into giant drops decorating the suit, which is quite a wicked effect, but I digresses :D You can tell this image intrigued me, well done, good job.', '2013-08-10 05:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
