(7085104, 1078220, 28427, '<td valign="top">Moving time :) Horrible days because you can''t find your stuff when you need it.  You''re moving, but at the same time your life continues.  And the same happens in the new house: again search parties for stuff until everything is finally unpacked and you can start to get used to the new environment.</td>', 'Moving time :) Horrible days because you can''t find your stuff when you need it.  You''re moving, but at the same time your life continues.  And the same happens in the new house: again search parties for stuff until everything is finally unpacked and you can start to get used to the new environment.', '2013-08-10 16:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
