(7085867, 1077928, 12611, '<td valign="top">filled with great depth and mystery. I don''t want to know the real story, I want to speculate a while...</td>', 'filled with great depth and mystery. I don''t want to know the real story, I want to speculate a while...', '2013-08-12 11:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7085868, 1077620, 12611, '<td valign="top">the eastern tiger swallowtail- my favorite butterfly, quite a shame, such is life...</td>', 'the eastern tiger swallowtail- my favorite butterfly, quite a shame, such is life...', '2013-08-12 11:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7085871, 1078225, 114285, '<td valign="top">I feel like I''m watching someone exit into the unknown, although there is light at the end of the tunnel, it seems to be a fiery fire he may be entering into.<br/> <br/>Wondering if this is Petra, very awesome image, and pretty sure it''s the blue, also very sure Peter would love this image, bumping up to a 10.</td>', 'I feel like I''m watching someone exit into the unknown, although there is light at the end of the tunnel, it seems to be a fiery fire he may be entering into. Wondering if this is Petra, very awesome image, and pretty sure it''s the blue, also very sure Peter would love this image, bumping up to a 10.', '2013-08-12 11:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086098, 1078295, 12611, '<td valign="top">I feel the same way when I look in the mirror.</td>', 'I feel the same way when I look in the mirror.', '2013-08-12 17:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086432, 1078308, 114285, '<td valign="top">Pretty sure this one is Tiberius, nice lighting, and lovely tones, cute smile on the boy.</td>', 'Pretty sure this one is Tiberius, nice lighting, and lovely tones, cute smile on the boy.', '2013-08-13 10:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086439, 1078281, 12611, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful blue.</td>', 'Simply beautiful blue.', '2013-08-13 11:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086440, 1078121, 12611, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting and the effect. a good story.</td>', 'Love the lighting and the effect. a good story.', '2013-08-13 11:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086442, 1078286, 12611, '<td valign="top">great crop and aged green/instagram look. great way to show but not truly tell.</td>', 'great crop and aged green/instagram look. great way to show but not truly tell.', '2013-08-13 11:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086443, 1078316, 12611, '<td valign="top">The drama of this shot, through tone and processing, is quite well done. Such and off kilter, wonderfully frenetic, vibrant view of young life.9</td>', 'The drama of this shot, through tone and processing, is quite well done. Such and off kilter, wonderfully frenetic, vibrant view of young life.9', '2013-08-13 11:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086444, 1078317, 12611, '<td valign="top">the composition, the figure in the back, the cross, they all add to the drama, that is created by the bare wrists and hands, waves of black shiny hair...</td>', 'the composition, the figure in the back, the cross, they all add to the drama, that is created by the bare wrists and hands, waves of black shiny hair...', '2013-08-13 11:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086445, 1078032, 12611, '<td valign="top">The dark glow works beautifully.</td>', 'The dark glow works beautifully.', '2013-08-13 11:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086537, 1078316, 94815, '<td valign="top">Learning to walk on water. Quite a story here. voted earlier</td>', 'Learning to walk on water. Quite a story here. voted earlier', '2013-08-13 15:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086538, 1078308, 94815, '<td valign="top">Love this one. A little pocket of joy in an otherwise drab street scene. bump</td>', 'Love this one. A little pocket of joy in an otherwise drab street scene. bump', '2013-08-13 15:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086540, 1078300, 94815, '<td valign="top">Good capture. I''m intrigued by the bleached white bg. voted earlier</td>', 'Good capture. I''m intrigued by the bleached white bg. voted earlier', '2013-08-13 15:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086557, 1078245, 94815, '<td valign="top">Has a distinctly eastern (as in Asian) flavor. Nice airbruch technique. Ever see any of the work of Steve Conley? bump</td>', 'Has a distinctly eastern (as in Asian) flavor. Nice airbruch technique. Ever see any of the work of Steve Conley? bump', '2013-08-13 15:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086560, 1078317, 94815, '<td valign="top">Captures the atmosphere and mood well. Good tint and comp. Love the shadowy figure in the rear. bump</td>', 'Captures the atmosphere and mood well. Good tint and comp. Love the shadowy figure in the rear. bump', '2013-08-13 15:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086562, 1078286, 94815, '<td valign="top">Cheerfully evocative of demuring beauty. But I must be too old because I can''t get used to the nose-pierced jewelry. bump</td>', 'Cheerfully evocative of demuring beauty. But I must be too old because I can''t get used to the nose-pierced jewelry. bump', '2013-08-13 15:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086563, 1077620, 94815, '<td valign="top">Incredible catch. Probably not much of a fight. bump</td>', 'Incredible catch. Probably not much of a fight. bump', '2013-08-13 15:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086566, 1078279, 94815, '<td valign="top">The futility of the constant smile. I think she''s chuckling at him.  voted earlier</td>', 'The futility of the constant smile. I think she''s chuckling at him.  voted earlier', '2013-08-13 15:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086569, 1078293, 94815, '<td valign="top">Sparse humanity in this sterile environment - almost as if it was not intended to be tread upon by the commoner. Good angle and lines keep it interesting. voted earlier</td>', 'Sparse humanity in this sterile environment - almost as if it was not intended to be tread upon by the commoner. Good angle and lines keep it interesting. voted earlier', '2013-08-13 15:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086573, 1078072, 94815, '<td valign="top">Could be a chapter of "The Lord of the Flies" as the kids alone in the wild scramble to gather firewood. The turbulent sky and glistening grass bristle with energy and tension. bump</td>', 'Could be a chapter of "The Lord of the Flies" as the kids alone in the wild scramble to gather firewood. The turbulent sky and glistening grass bristle with energy and tension. bump', '2013-08-13 15:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086575, 1078217, 94815, '<td valign="top">Urban shoe culture and a skeptic.</td>', 'Urban shoe culture and a skeptic.', '2013-08-13 15:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086576, 1077934, 16148, '<td valign="top">Such a big story for a simple image.  I really like how you composed the skyline.</td>', 'Such a big story for a simple image.  I really like how you composed the skyline.', '2013-08-13 15:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086579, 1078246, 16148, '<td valign="top">Very enjoyable image and your title helps direct us.</td>', 'Very enjoyable image and your title helps direct us.', '2013-08-13 15:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086621, 1077951, 112828, '<td valign="top">Interesting location - looks maybe just a bit sharp for my taste, but it''s really quite a fun pic!<br/> <br/>What amazing workmanship on behalf of the gardener.</td>', 'Interesting location - looks maybe just a bit sharp for my taste, but it''s really quite a fun pic! What amazing workmanship on behalf of the gardener.', '2013-08-13 16:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086623, 1078302, 112828, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I love the effect this has, I want a portrait of my cat like this in fact.</td>', 'Very nice.  I love the effect this has, I want a portrait of my cat like this in fact.', '2013-08-13 16:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086625, 1078287, 112828, '<td valign="top">We are the photographers, we are the storytellers, these are our pens.</td>', 'We are the photographers, we are the storytellers, these are our pens.', '2013-08-13 16:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086627, 1078205, 112828, '<td valign="top">Extremely clever.  :D<br/> <br/>I think the processing is a little iffy here, but overall it''s nice, and a really fun concept, I''d like to see more of these images with Legos.</td>', 'Extremely clever.  :D I think the processing is a little iffy here, but overall it''s nice, and a really fun concept, I''d like to see more of these images with Legos.', '2013-08-13 16:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086632, 1078279, 112828, '<td valign="top">Yeah, that doesn''t look fun.  I ''feel'' it for sure.<br/> <br/>Nice image, but the perspective issue really hurts this for me, just a fast correction in Photoshop would have really enhanced the symmetry here.<br/> <br/>And that cigarette butt, love it - really quite excellent details and color on the processing, very true and perfectly sharpened.</td>', 'Yeah, that doesn''t look fun.  I ''feel'' it for sure. Nice image, but the perspective issue really hurts this for me, just a fast correction in Photoshop would have really enhanced the symmetry here. And that cigarette butt, love it - really quite excellent details and color on the processing, very true and perfectly sharpened.', '2013-08-13 16:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086633, 1078172, 112828, '<td valign="top">Time always wins, and the tide will turn - but the game is enjoyable while it lasts.</td>', 'Time always wins, and the tide will turn - but the game is enjoyable while it lasts.', '2013-08-13 16:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086638, 1078316, 112828, '<td valign="top">Hmm.  Interesting emotion, but you should have a doctor look at that left foot, I think there may be some serious medical issues this child needs to worry about.<br/> <br/>Honestly, I''m joking of course, but really, the image had some great potential, but the tilted horizon, and the really sloppy masking on the coloring work very much takes away from this otherwise lovely image.</td>', 'Hmm.  Interesting emotion, but you should have a doctor look at that left foot, I think there may be some serious medical issues this child needs to worry about. Honestly, I''m joking of course, but really, the image had some great potential, but the tilted horizon, and the really sloppy masking on the coloring work very much takes away from this otherwise lovely image.', '2013-08-13 16:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086643, 1078308, 112828, '<td valign="top">Fantastic.  Simply Fantastic.</td>', 'Fantastic.  Simply Fantastic.', '2013-08-13 16:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086644, 1078274, 112828, '<td valign="top">A fine image which fits the challenge well.  It won''t ribbon I suspect, but it absolutely captures the spirit of the challenge I think.</td>', 'A fine image which fits the challenge well.  It won''t ribbon I suspect, but it absolutely captures the spirit of the challenge I think.', '2013-08-13 16:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086645, 1077925, 112828, '<td valign="top">What a great scene from a b-film!</td>', 'What a great scene from a b-film!', '2013-08-13 16:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086647, 1077980, 112828, '<td valign="top">Neat story!  Really like his board, would love to see that in huge detail.</td>', 'Neat story!  Really like his board, would love to see that in huge detail.', '2013-08-13 16:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086649, 1078295, 112828, '<td valign="top">A really cool photo!!<br/> <br/>I don''t know that I totally get the relationship to the challenge, but this is pretty easy to fit in any one of a hundred ways.</td>', 'A really cool photo!! I don''t know that I totally get the relationship to the challenge, but this is pretty easy to fit in any one of a hundred ways.', '2013-08-13 16:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086652, 1077879, 112828, '<td valign="top">The pink dress and background are pretty darn cool... not so enamoured with the beauty glow and the heavy vignette.</td>', 'The pink dress and background are pretty darn cool... not so enamoured with the beauty glow and the heavy vignette.', '2013-08-13 16:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086653, 1078260, 112828, '<td valign="top">What an interesting story, I''ll be back to read the details.</td>', 'What an interesting story, I''ll be back to read the details.', '2013-08-13 16:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086655, 1078255, 112828, '<td valign="top">Really cool image.  I''m sad about the highlights, but happy about every single other detail of this image.</td>', 'Really cool image.  I''m sad about the highlights, but happy about every single other detail of this image.', '2013-08-13 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086656, 1077988, 112828, '<td valign="top">EGG!</td>', 'EGG!', '2013-08-13 16:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086657, 1078190, 112828, '<td valign="top">Does she live here? Considering killing herself with tetanus perhaps?<br/> <br/>Seriously though, the work is solid enough, I just find the story to be a bit non-sequitur.</td>', 'Does she live here? Considering killing herself with tetanus perhaps? Seriously though, the work is solid enough, I just find the story to be a bit non-sequitur.', '2013-08-13 17:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086658, 1077971, 112828, '<td valign="top">I would have liked a more symmetrical positioning of the basket.<br/> <br/>Still, good, and an inspirational composition that I''d like to try myself.</td>', 'I would have liked a more symmetrical positioning of the basket. Still, good, and an inspirational composition that I''d like to try myself.', '2013-08-13 17:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086660, 1078283, 112828, '<td valign="top">Letting the days go by, water flowing underground, Letting the days go by, let the water hold me down...<br/> <br/>Once in a lifetime - same as it ever was.<br/> <br/>...<br/> <br/> <br/>Now, about that photo.  Good stuff, other than the blown highlights and deep shadow.  A bracketed exposure would have really been your best friend here.</td>', 'Letting the days go by, water flowing underground, Letting the days go by, let the water hold me down... Once in a lifetime - same as it ever was. ...  Now, about that photo.  Good stuff, other than the blown highlights and deep shadow.  A bracketed exposure would have really been your best friend here.', '2013-08-13 17:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086662, 1077784, 112828, '<td valign="top">Writings on the wall, but is that a gorilla I see down the hall?</td>', 'Writings on the wall, but is that a gorilla I see down the hall?', '2013-08-13 17:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086663, 1078328, 112828, '<td valign="top">No, no no...  Drains get finer with cleaning... It''s wines that get finer with age.<br/> <br/>Speaking of cleaning, you might want to start with some rather strong acid - looks like those minerals are gonna be tough!<br/> <br/>..<br/> <br/>Seriously though, nice photo, from an abstract perspective I think it''s lacking a little something that would take it to the top, but it is pretty darn good overall.  Great textures in the left hand portion of the image.</td>', 'No, no no...  Drains get finer with cleaning... It''s wines that get finer with age. Speaking of cleaning, you might want to start with some rather strong acid - looks like those minerals are gonna be tough! .. Seriously though, nice photo, from an abstract perspective I think it''s lacking a little something that would take it to the top, but it is pretty darn good overall.  Great textures in the left hand portion of the image.', '2013-08-13 17:07:59.000000', NULL, 1);
