(7086735, 1078310, 112828, '<td valign="top">I really like this image of grass seeds.  Superb concept, but the execution is just a little weak, the sky is featureless, and even a bit of fill-flash would have added wonderful texture to this.<br/> <br/>Still, I really do like it.</td>', 'I really like this image of grass seeds.  Superb concept, but the execution is just a little weak, the sky is featureless, and even a bit of fill-flash would have added wonderful texture to this. Still, I really do like it.', '2013-08-13 19:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
