(7086757, 1078284, 112828, '<td valign="top">You''ve pulled the shadows too hard here.  I see what you were going for, but there are two ways to deal with this.<br/> <br/>The first, is a massive hit of noise reduction, the other is to embrace the grain, and convert to black and white, while adding a bit more to even things out.<br/> <br/>Great image for Peter, and really a powerful image as well, very spooky cloud mass there!</td>', 'You''ve pulled the shadows too hard here.  I see what you were going for, but there are two ways to deal with this. The first, is a massive hit of noise reduction, the other is to embrace the grain, and convert to black and white, while adding a bit more to even things out. Great image for Peter, and really a powerful image as well, very spooky cloud mass there!', '2013-08-13 19:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
