(7086827, 1078264, 115814, '<td valign="top">Lovely sentiment. The boy''s posture implies confidence and pride to be with dad. The DOF choice works well for me too in setting a mood. I''m ambivalent about the upper right sharp foliage. One minute it seems distracting, the next it''s providing an interesting focal context. Nice work -  a top pick for me.</td>', 'Lovely sentiment. The boy''s posture implies confidence and pride to be with dad. The DOF choice works well for me too in setting a mood. I''m ambivalent about the upper right sharp foliage. One minute it seems distracting, the next it''s providing an interesting focal context. Nice work -  a top pick for me.', '2013-08-13 21:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086829, 1078215, 115814, '<td valign="top">There''s almost a left to right progression of faces from smiling to neutral to frowning. Somehow I don''t want to be the guy in the middle.</td>', 'There''s almost a left to right progression of faces from smiling to neutral to frowning. Somehow I don''t want to be the guy in the middle.', '2013-08-13 21:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
