(7087292, 1078308, 8759, '<td valign="top">Wow! I am honored! I am really happy this won Peter''s challenge.<br/> <br/>Sorry for the late reply. I was out without Internet... <br/> <br/>I did promise myself to honor Peter and his courage by taking part in this challenge. <br/> <br/>I was on a business trip but I hit the streets taking Peter with me in my mind and watched some stories. This happened to be the best for its joy, laughter and hope. <br/> <br/>Thanks Peter for being so inspiring. <br/> <br/>Love you brother and hugs from the girls.<br/> <br/>Tibi<br/> <br/>PS: It is a candid.</td>', 'Wow! I am honored! I am really happy this won Peter''s challenge. Sorry for the late reply. I was out without Internet...  I did promise myself to honor Peter and his courage by taking part in this challenge.  I was on a business trip but I hit the streets taking Peter with me in my mind and watched some stories. This happened to be the best for its joy, laughter and hope.  Thanks Peter for being so inspiring.  Love you brother and hugs from the girls. Tibi PS: It is a candid.', '2013-08-14 12:19:53.000000', NULL, 0),
