(7087460, 1078072, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the ribbon Anita. It''s a fabulous shot - the children, their relative positions/poses/action,(couldn''t have been better if you''d been directing them)the dune, sky, bird etc, etc - all wonderful.</td>', 'Congratulations on the ribbon Anita. It''s a fabulous shot - the children, their relative positions/poses/action,(couldn''t have been better if you''d been directing them)the dune, sky, bird etc, etc - all wonderful.', '2013-08-14 20:22:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(7087465, 1078252, 49018, '<td valign="top">Glad you found the comment appropriate (didn''t mean to have anybody almost break in tears though :) )<br/>Certainly the words of the Baroness suits the image well, or the other way around. I always have a sinking feeling when reading that "I had a farm in Africa", what a great opening..<br/>Beautiful photograph, I am glad it was appreciated.</td>', 'Glad you found the comment appropriate (didn''t mean to have anybody almost break in tears though :) )Certainly the words of the Baroness suits the image well, or the other way around. I always have a sinking feeling when reading that "I had a farm in Africa", what a great opening..Beautiful photograph, I am glad it was appreciated.', '2013-08-14 20:39:55.000000', NULL, 0),
